5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We should prioritize evidence of past outcomes before committing more funds. I want to see what previous trials actually achieved.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with the need for evidence, though I am more concerned with the physical and systemic capacity to handle new programs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start. While we chase success, let us not forget to examine why some of our previous ambitions simply vanished into thin air.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to help! I think it's really important to make sure the people working on these programs aren't too tired.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us look deeply into the foundations, ensuring our vision is sustainable for the years to come.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if you are worried about capacity, we should look at the staffing reviews and the booking system records.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,That is a reasonable suggestion. I will look into the logistics of the facility and the booking system.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, your focus on outcomes is admirable, but I suspect the ""outcomes"" are often masked by poor documentation of failure.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that sounds a bit sad! Maybe we can find something positive? I want to see how the nursing staff are doing!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us gather the facts first. I wish to understand the true nature of our financial boundaries.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
