34,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data shows that the call-back trial actually worked for elderly patients, yet it was abandoned. We must not repeat that mistake.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The booking system is a black hole. Any program that relies on ""informal"" slots will be invisible and likely cause a bottleneck.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"How fascinating. It seems our history is a graveyard of ""great ideas"" that lacked a signature or a designated owner to hold the bag.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Oh dear... I found out that some of our nurses are really struggling with vacancies! We can't add more work to their plates right now.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The river of finance is narrower than we imagined. We must be careful not to build a bridge that we cannot afford to maintain.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, I understand the staffing concern, but the call-back trial proved a tangible benefit to patients. We cannot ignore efficacy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, efficacy is irrelevant if the facility seizes up. The parking and rooms are already at capacity by mid-morning.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, a point well taken. If we build a program on a foundation of ""hope"" and ""handshakes,"" it will collapse by year two.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,I just don't want anyone to get burned out! Maybe we can pick a program that helps the staff too?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,Balance is the key to longevity. We must find a path that serves the patient without exhausting the healer or the treasury.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we choose a program with a proven track record, like the call-back system, we reduce the risk of wasting the budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Only if that program can be integrated into the existing booking system without creating a physical logjam in the corridors.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"And only if the outside partners actually sign the agreements. I've seen how ""joint ventures"" here tend to become ""someone else's problem.""","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, if we can find a way to make it easier for the nurses, I'm all for it!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that a small, sustainable seed is better than a grand tree that withers in the first drought.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
